Package: audiobible-data
Version: 1.1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Reuben Institute <reubeninstitute@gmail.com>
Description: Verse-level timing, alignment, and duration metadata for AudioBible
 Per-verse timing (original.csv), cloned-audio duration and word
 alignment (cloned.csv, alignment.csv), and English dub duration
 (english.csv) for Reuben Institute's AudioBible, consumed by
 ScripturesStudio to build videos and drive the editing UI.
